  </p>

  <h2 id="multi-stage">Why this is a genuinely two-stage competition</h2>

  <p>
    The "just clear NET or GATE and do a PhD" framing hides a pattern this site flags explicitly
    wherever it genuinely applies: clearing the well-known filter does not end the competition. It
    restarts it, in a different, less-discussed form, right when you expect to finally be done.
  </p>

  <div class="stage-grid">
    {stageComparison.map((item) => (
      <div class="stage-card">
