  <h2 id="next-step">What to do next</h2>

  <p>
    Do not default to "apply for a government Scientist post" simply because it is the track that
    sounds most stable and respectable. The label that sounds safest at a family gathering does not
    have the strongest growth curve, and the genuinely two-stage competition inside the government
    pipeline rarely gets explained honestly before someone spends years assuming it away.
  </p>

  <div class="highlight-box highlight-box--teal">
