      Pick the track using The 4-Checkpoint Protocol above — your energy, your real runway, current
      demand for your specific specialisation, and AI exposure — not just which title sounds most
      impressive today.
    </p>
    <p>
      Then pass The 3 Gates on one small, real test before you commit a JRF application, a corporate
      R&D offer, or a consulting pitch to it.
    </p>
  </div>

